  "details": "There are 2 kinds of loading screens right now. There's a 3D one when you're downloading a world, and a 2D one when you're entering a world. When open beta released custom loading screens, I was disappointed to see it limited to 2D most of the time. I have fast internet and usually visit cached worlds.\n\nSome people in the VRC discord pointed out that while the 2D screen means SteamVR is overriding rendering, you can still keep playing the music and put a model in there! https://github.com/ValveSoftware/openvr/wiki/Compositor-Skinning",
